---
description: VOYA project rules entry point
alwaysApply: true
---
Before any work, read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root and follow it. Read docs/PROGRESS.md and the last entries of docs/SESSION_LOG.md first; the owner's plan and brief are in the gitignored .voya-private/ folder. Before stopping for any reason, append a session summary as described in AGENTS.md. Never write prompts, question lists, answers or transcripts into the repo.
